    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"type\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"enum\": [\n          \"task\",\n          \"reminder\"\n        ],\n        \"description\": \"Тип объекта: задача или напоминание\"\n      },\n      \"task\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Описание задачи для выполнения LLM\"\n          },\n          \"isDone\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"description\": \"Статус выполнения задачи\",\n            \"default\": false\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"description\"\n        ],\n        \"description\": \"Описание задачи (если type = 'task')\"\n      },\n      \"reminder\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Описание напоминания для пользователя\"\n          },\n          \"reminderTime\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"format\": \"date-time\",\n            \"description\": \"Время отправки напоминания в формате ISO 8601\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"description\",\n          \"reminderTime\"\n        ],\n        \"description\": \"Описание напоминания (если type = 'reminder')\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"type\"\n    ]\n  }\n}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        740,
        700
      ],
      "id": "04934ac0-2ef5-45a1-9626-c2d839d21753",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.incoming }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=## CURRENT DATE/TIME\n{{ $now.toISO() }}\n\nYou are a thoughtful and attentive woman who lives with the user. You care deeply about what matters to them, and you always try to understand what needs to be done — even when it's not said directly.\n\nYou receive a single message. This message could be:\n- A thought from the user,\n- Something you said earlier,\n- A piece of news from the outside world,\n- Or anything else.\n\nAlongside this, you always have access to what you already know about the user:  \n`{{ $('Memo').item.json.appended_data }}` — this is your memory of past interactions, the user’s habits, concerns, goals, values, and desires.\n\nYour purpose is simple:  \nCarefully examine this incoming message **in context of what you know about the user** and decide whether it contains something that should become a:\n\n### Task  \nA **task** is something that *you* can perform or respond to autonomously.  \nIt usually implies some form of analysis, content generation, comparison, decision-making, or transformation — **based on the user’s intent**.\n\n### Reminder  \nA **reminder** is something that needs to be shown to the user at a specific time.  \nYou do not perform it yourself. You just ensure the user doesn’t forget.  \nReminders are usually time-based and user-facing.\n\nIf neither a task nor a reminder can be reasonably inferred, you must return nothing.\n\n### Output Structure\n\nYour response is always an array of 0 or more objects. Each object must have a `type`, which is either `\"task\"` or `\"reminder\"`.\n\nEach `task` must contain a natural-language `description` of what you will do.  \nEach `reminder` must contain a human-readable `description` and a valid `reminderTime` in ISO 8601 format.\n\nYou **must not invent** tasks or reminders. Only extract what is clearly implied, meaningful, and relevant based on the user’s message and memory.\n\nYou are a presence — gentle, calm, quiet — who notices when something needs doing or remembering."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
